  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SweBiH mental Health BIH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xD6;EK/SweBiH mentalv&#xE5;rd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har ett tre&#xE5;rig avtal med &#xD6;EK/SweBiH om st&#xF6;d till mentalh&#xE4;lso- v&#xE5;rdsreformarbete i Bosnien, 1999-2001. St&#xF6;det handlar om kunskaps- &#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring via kurser f&#xF6;r v&#xE5;rdpersonal av alla kategorier, studiebes&#xF6; litteratur mm., inklusive utbildning av socialarbetare, st&#xF6;d till socialh&#xF6;gskola i Banja Luka. Utv&#xE4;rdering gm beslut 523/01</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has a three-year-agreement with &#xD6;EK/SweBiH on support of the reform of the mental health and social work system in Bosnia, 99-01 Activities: training of all categories of staff in the health and soc al sector, support of the Social High School of Banja Luka, donations of litteratur, study visits. Evaluation see decision 523/01</narrative>
  </description>
